// A socket named augogen is not the plate directory.
// The read ignores it and does not open it.
// The write replaces that socket with a directory and does not open it.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE augsock ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG augsock law

IMPULSE augsock 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "augsock" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
